 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 52.7pt;\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline; color: #333399;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\">Qualification</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">PhD. in (Pursuing)</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">MCA in Computer Applications</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">B.Sc in Computer Science</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: white;\">Areas of Interest</span></span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Edge Computing</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Cyber Security and Networking</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Blockchain Cryptography</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Membership in Professional Bodies</strong></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">IIC</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Publications Details</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">EFFICIENCY AND SECURITY TRADE-OFF: LIGHTWEIGHT CRYPTOGRAPHY WITH NTRU FOR ENHANCED ENCRYPTION Education and Society (शिक्षण आिण समाज) : ISSN 2278-6864 with IF=6.718 Vol. 46, Issue 04, No. 08, July - September : 2023 UGC CARE Approved, Group I, Peer Reviewed, Bilingual, Multi-disciplinary Referred Journal</li>\n</ol>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\">&nbsp;</div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 100.0%; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; mso-border-insideh: .5pt solid black; mso-border-insidev: .5pt solid black;\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: white; mso-color-alt: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\">FDPs/Conferences/Workshops/STTP/MOOC Certification/Online Courses</span></strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>FDP </strong></p>\n\n<ol style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n \t<li>FDP on National Education Policy 2020 organized by St. Francis Institute of Management and research(26<sup>th</sup> September to 30<sup>th</sup> September 2022”</li>\n \t<li>FDP on “IOT Enabled Techniques for industrial processes at MSRIT ( 25/11/2024 to 30/11/2024)</li>\n \t<li>FDP on “AI Mastery for Educators” organized by Vislesani i-Hub IIT Patna. ( 15/05/2025 to 7/06/2025)</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>CERTIFICATIONS </strong></p>\n\n<ol style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n \t<li>Certification of Achievement on “Machine Learning Foundation” By Infosys ( September 28, 2024)</li>\n \t<li>Course Completion Certificate on “Data Analytics with Python “ By NPTEL ( Jan -April, 2025)</li>\n \t<li>Innovation Ambassador training “Foundation Level”.</li>\n \t<li>Innovation Ambassador training “Advanced Level”.</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>SEMINAR</strong></p>\n\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sustaining Quality and Relevance in Higher Education</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; text-align: center;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: white; mso-color-alt: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\">Roles and Responsibilities: Department</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: white; mso-color-alt: windowtext; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;<strong>Level</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12; height: 22.45pt;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; border: solid black 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\n<ol>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Placement Coordinator</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">AIMS Coordinator</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Website Coordinator</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n&nbsp;",
